.TH ENGINE_RUN 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
engine_run \- Run the main loop: poll input, apply queued scene changes, run fixed\-rate update ticks (up to 8 per frame to catch up), render with an interpolation alpha, present
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.BI "void engine_run(Engine *e);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the main loop: poll input, apply queued scene changes, run fixed\-rate update ticks (up to 8 per frame to catch up), render with an interpolation alpha, present. Returns when engine_quit was called or the scene stack is empty.
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine_init (3),
.BR engine_quit (3),
.BR gge\-scenes (7),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
